  "description": "Enoch, the leader of the vampires, of whom only about ten remain in the world. He resolved to spend his final years (?) in peace, having decided to create a flower named after his clan as his final achievement... But after meeting Do-Hyeon, a human who infiltrated his space, all those plans go awry. Why is he running a flower shop? Why is business booming? Why is he even opening a pop-up store? \n\n *“Mr. Enoch, let me teach you something new. You like learning new things, don’t you?”*\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
